   "THE_READING": "**the face now serves, and the blast radius is 0** — the number of LIVE items, which is zero. The face opening does not open the district: an item reaches a child only when it is LIVE, and nothing is."
  },
  "THE_VISIBLE_BUT_EMPTY_WINDOW": {
   "figure": "OPEN — and this is the measurement, not a hypothetical",
   "what": "**the window is now OPEN: the case is visible and has no items to serve.** Landing the face before any item is LIVE is exactly the sequence R857 named as the only one that opens it. It is open deliberately and under instruction, it is measured here rather than discovered later, and it closes the moment the first item goes LIVE or the face is withdrawn.",
   "andWHATACHILDWOULDSEE": "the case face renders and the case has nothing behind it. **Whether that is acceptable for the interval before publication is David's to rule** — this store reports it as a figure rather than deciding it."
  }
 },
 "PUBLICATION_STILL_HOLDS": "no item was set LIVE. The six mints and their joins remain the last open item, and her join condition binds them: an entry whose option does not compute as its behaviour waits for its true carrier (R865, wired and canaried).",
